{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11110200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1111020001:1":{"text":"잘 싸웠어.","source_cn":"打得痛快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04E3CC3297B524FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111020002:1":{"text":"나쁘지 않은 실력이군.","source_cn":"你身手不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC89AAAB7A704D7E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111020003:1":{"text":"너도.","source_cn":"你也不差。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC49611206E0ECE5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111020004:1":{"text":"분이 좀 풀려?","source_cn":"解气了没？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBD24A54D7779A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111020005:1":{"text":"분이 풀렸다기보단 케케묵은 복수심이 다시 불타오르는 것 같은데.","source_cn":"比起解气，更像仇恨的火药被重新点爆了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B160D146DD8C8EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111020006:1":{"text":"...조금 전 그놈이 했던 말 중에 뭐 궁금한 거 없어?","source_cn":"……刚才那混蛋说的话，你没什么要问的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED071CE9E0EBF456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111020007:1":{"text":"말했잖아, 난 당신의 과거에 관심 없다고.","source_cn":"我说过，你的过去，我不关心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC7921848335789","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111020008:1":{"text":"너와 와이어트 사이에 무슨 일이 있었는지, 그가 어떻게 죽었는지, 왜 복수하려고 하는지, 전부 나완 상관없는 일이야.","source_cn":"你和怀亚特之间发生了什么，他怎么牺牲，你为什么寻仇，和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x595685C0494835BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111020009:1":{"text":"하지만 네가 여전히 프랭크를 날려버리고 싶다면 계속 동행해도 좋아.","source_cn":"但是，只要你还想彻底击溃弗兰克，我们就可以继续同路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A9314D74BE767E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111020010:1":{"text":"부족원을 구하러 가는 게 아니었나?","source_cn":"你不是为了救族人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x721CFC65A3458164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111020011:1":{"text":"겸사겸사 사막의 발톱 두목 한둘 정도는 더 날려버려도 괜찮지.","source_cn":"也可以再顺手击败一两个流沙之爪的首领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x520009464B273DDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111020012:1":{"text":"트라이브의 명예와 신념을 포기한 놈들에게 누군가는 교훈을 줘야 하니까.","source_cn":"对于那些背弃了蛮血荣耀和信念的混蛋，得有人给他们一点教训。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA51F9B683C4ACD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111020013:1":{"text":"맞아요! 아센 사막에도 막무가내로 구는 부족이 있지만, 사막의 발톱만큼 악독하지는 않아요!","source_cn":"就是就是，荒角沙漠的氏族虽然有的也不讲理，但也不像流沙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x254F323BE2DA6FFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111020014:1":{"text":"저처럼 성격 좋은 순둥이도 더는 못 참겠어요!","source_cn":"连我这么好脾气的姑娘，都看不下去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080C710344F3B87D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1111020014":{"text":"저처럼 성격 좋은 순둥이도 더는 못 참겠어요!","source_cn":"连我这么好脾气的姑娘，都看不下去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080C710344F3B87D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111020015:1":{"text":"방금 처리한 사막의 발톱은 프랭크의 부하인 하트라고 해.","source_cn":"刚才被咱们干掉的那个流沙之爪，叫鬣心。算是弗兰克的副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACA36C68F3A44DE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_